<%@ Page Title="About The Ranger" Language="C#" MasterPageFile="~/Site.Master" AutoEventWireup="true" CodeBehind="About.aspx.cs" Inherits="The_Ranger.About" %>
<asp:Content ID="BodyContent" ContentPlaceHolderID="MainContent" runat="server"><section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="page-kicker">ABOUT THE RANGER</div><h1 class="page-title">A simpler way to experience the wild.</h1><p class="mb-0 opacity-75">The Ranger brings accommodation, guided game drives and online bookings together in one professional safari management platform.</p></div></section><section class="page-shell"><div class="container"><div class="row g-5 align-items-center mb-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="surface overflow-hidden"><img src="/Images/wilderness.jpg" class="img-fluid w-100" alt="African wilderness" style="min-height:360px;object-fit:cover;" /></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="page-kicker">OUR PURPOSE</div><h2 class="font-display display-6">Experience the wild differently.</h2><p class="muted">The Ranger is designed to make safari planning clear and convenient. Clients can discover available stays and game drives, compare options, make reservations and keep track of their bookings from one dashboard.</p><p class="muted mb-0">Owners have their own management workspace where they can maintain accommodation, manage game-drive experiences and respond to guest bookings.</p></div></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-md-4"><div class="surface p-4 h-100"><div class="feature-icon mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-compass"></i></div><h3 class="font-display h4">Discover</h3><p class="muted mb-0">Browse real accommodation and guided game-drive experiences available through the system.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="surface p-4 h-100"><div class="feature-icon mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i></div><h3 class="font-display h4">Book</h3><p class="muted mb-0">Reserve a stay or game drive, see your booking status and cancel eligible reservations.</p></div></div><div class="col-md-4"><div class="surface p-4 h-100"><div class="feature-icon mb-3"><i class="fa-solid fa-binoculars"></i></div><h3 class="font-display h4">Explore</h3><p class="muted mb-0">Turn a simple online booking into a memorable safari experience in the African wilderness.</p></div></div></div></div></section></asp:Content>